<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"/>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>MindAura — Lien invalide</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="{{ asset('images/logo.png') }}"/>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,700;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    :root {
      --green:       #1B4332; --green-mid:   #2D6A4F;
      --green-light: #52B788; --green-pale:  #D8F3DC;
      --green-xpale: #EBF7F0; --violet:      #7B5EA7;
      --violet-light:rgba(123,94,167,.12);
      --bg:          #F0F4F8; --white:       #FFFFFF;
      --text:        #1A1A2E; --text-sec:    #5A6475;
      --border:      #D5DCE6;
      --shadow:      0 24px 64px rgba(27,67,50,.18), 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.7);
      --radius:      22px;
    }
    html,body { height:100%; font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif; background:var(--bg); color:var(--text); overflow:hidden; }
    .bg-canvas { position:fixed; inset:0; z-index:0; background:url("{{ asset('images/background.jpg') }}") center/cover no-repeat; }
    .bg-canvas::before { content:''; position:absolute; inset:0; background:rgba(0,0,0,.35); }
    .wrapper { position:relative; z-index:1; height:100vh; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; padding:16px; }

    .card {
      width:100%; max-width:480px;
      background:var(--white); border-radius:var(--radius);
      box-shadow:var(--shadow); overflow:hidden; position:relative;
      animation:cardIn .7s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1) both;
    }
    .card::before {
      content:''; position:absolute; top:0; left:0; right:0; height:3px;
      background:linear-gradient(90deg,#EF4444,#F97316,var(--violet)); z-index:10;
    }
    @keyframes cardIn { from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px) scale(.95)} to{opacity:1;transform:none} }

    .card-body { padding:52px 44px 48px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; text-align:center; gap:0; }

    .icon-wrap {
      width:88px; height:88px; border-radius:24px;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg,#FEF2F2,#FEE2E2);
      border:2px solid #FCA5A5;
      display:grid; place-items:center; margin-bottom:28px;
      font-size:2.6rem;
      animation:bounceIn .8s .2s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1) both;
    }
    @keyframes bounceIn { from{opacity:0;transform:scale(.4)} to{opacity:1;transform:scale(1)} }

    .badge-error {
      display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:5px;
      background:#FEF2F2; color:#991B1B;
      font-size:.69rem; font-weight:700; border-radius:99px;
      padding:3px 12px; letter-spacing:.4px; text-transform:uppercase;
      border:1px solid #FCA5A5; margin-bottom:14px;
    }
    .card-title { font-family:'Playfair Display',serif; font-size:1.7rem; color:var(--text); margin-bottom:12px; }
    .card-desc  { font-size:.88rem; color:var(--text-sec); line-height:1.6; max-width:350px; margin-bottom:32px; }

    .btn-primary {
      display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:10px;
      width:100%; padding:13px;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--green),var(--green-mid));
      color:#fff; border:none; border-radius:13px;
      font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif; font-size:.92rem; font-weight:700;
      cursor:pointer; text-decoration:none; letter-spacing:.4px;
      transition:transform .18s, box-shadow .25s; margin-bottom:10px;
    }
    .btn-primary:hover { transform:translateY(-2px); box-shadow:0 12px 32px rgba(27,67,50,.35); }

    .btn-ghost {
      display:block; width:100%; padding:12px; text-align:center;
      color:var(--text-sec); text-decoration:none; font-size:.88rem; font-weight:600;
      border:1.5px solid var(--border); border-radius:13px;
      transition:all .2s;
    }
    .btn-ghost:hover { border-color:var(--green-light); color:var(--green); background:var(--green-xpale); }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="bg-canvas"></div>
<div class="wrapper">
  <div class="card">
    <div class="card-body">

      <div class="icon-wrap">⛔</div>

      <div class="badge-error">Lien invalide</div>

      <h1 class="card-title">Lien expiré ou invalide</h1>
      <p class="card-desc">
        Ce lien de confirmation est introuvable ou a expiré (validité 24 h).<br/>
        Recommencez l'inscription pour recevoir un nouveau lien.
      </p>

      <a href="{{ path('app_register') }}" class="btn-primary">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="2">
          <path d="M10 4v12M4 10h12" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        </svg>
        Recommencer l'inscription
      </a>
      <a href="{{ path('app_login') }}" class="btn-ghost">Retour à la connexion</a>

    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
